# 默认使用已部署的测试环境。
# 本地开发改为 http://localhost:3000/api/v1，并使用目标环境协议接口返回的版本。
@baseUrl = http://47.97.46.242/api/v1
@termsVersion = 2026-10-23-test
@privacyVersion = 2026-10-23-test
@accessToken = replace-with-returned-access-token
@refreshToken = replace-with-returned-refresh-token
@sessionId = replace-with-returned-session-id

### 服务与数据库健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 当前用户协议
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/legal-documents/TERMS

### 当前隐私政策
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/legal-documents/PRIVACY

### 注册（先读取上面两份协议，核对版本；无需验证码）
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+8613800000000",
  "password": "Example#Password9",
  "nickname": "小雨",
  "termsVersion": "{{termsVersion}}",
  "privacyVersion": "{{privacyVersion}}"
}

### 密码登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/password
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"+8613800000000","password":"Example#Password9"}

### 本人资料
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 刷新（成功后替换上方两个令牌）
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### 本人有效会话
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/sessions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 撤销指定的本人会话（将列表中的 id 填入 sessionId）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/me/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 修改密码（完成后所有设备须重新登录）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword":"Example#Password9","newPassword":"New#Password123"}

### 退出当前会话
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
